OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy
OL,6,Fshowers or thunderstorms are possible
OL,7,Fthis evening and into the early hours
OL,8,Fof Saturday, most likely across
OL,9,FNorfolk and The Wash. Dry for many by
OL,10,Fthe morning with clear periods.
OL,11,FRemaining warm and rather muggy for
OL,12,Fmost.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FVariable cloud and isolated
OL,15,Fthundery showers possible at first but
OL,16,Fbecoming dry with sunny spells.
OL,17,FGradually turning fresher later with a
OL,18,Fgentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
