OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith bright or sunny spells on Sunday
OL,7,Fand Monday. Cloudier and breezier with
OL,8,Fa chance of showers on Tuesday. Not as
OL,9,Fhot but temperatures remaining
OL,10,Fgenerally above average.
